{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120094410783-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120105341\"/><p>大浪灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（11月20日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的大浪灣泳灘；以及西貢區的銀線灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該3處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該3處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:03:55.305539+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T01:44:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:14.453762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T02:57:29.155744+00:00","content_hash":"9a399bb97cbef01ae48b79e1b26988ac815e4d5c349e7408472490a2c2c73687","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:03:55.305539+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}